   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\">Boa tarde,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\">Estou com um problema na interpretação (ou é um erro) dos resultados da RDA-Parcial usando a função &quot;varpart&quot; {vegan}.</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\">É possível ter valores de R² Ajustado menores que 0 (negativos) ou maiores que 1 (neste caso 1.986 para a porção não explicada).</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\">Qualquer ajuda será muito bem vinda.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\">\r\n\r\n<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\">O CMR segue abaixo:</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\">\r\n\r\n<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">(y&lt;-read.csv(&quot;<a href=\"http://ge.tt/api/1/files/51HX3Dc/0/blob?download\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ge.tt/api/1/files/51HX3Dc/0/blob?download&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244125515000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Q6bEj9IQoXhKYtlD1KK6U\">http://ge.tt/api/1/files/51HX3Dc/0/blob?download</a>&quot;,h=T))</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">(y.phys&lt;-y[,1:5])</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">(y.chem&lt;-y[,6:10])</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<font face=\"courier new, monospace\">(y.comu&lt;-y[,11:ncol(y)])</font></div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">require(vegan)</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">varpart(y.comu,y.phys,y.chem,transfo=&quot;hell&quot;)</font></div>\r\n\r\n</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\"><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\" class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n\r\nAbraços,</div><div style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\" class=\"gmail_default\">Luciano</div><br></div><div><br></div>-- <br><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 40px;border:none;padding:0px\">\r\n\r\n</blockquote><div><b style=\"font-size:12.727272033691406px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Luciano F. Sgarbi</b><br><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Mestrando em Ecologia e Evolução</span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Laboratório de Ecologia de Insetos (sl. 222)</span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.727272033691406px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Departamento de Ecologia<br>Instituto de Ciências Biológicas - ICB 1<br>Universidade Federal de Goiás, campus II<br>\r\n\r\nGoiânia-GO<br>74001-970</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;f